  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 11th level, the blue mage can copy any special qualities from creatures she has used the Libra ability on. As a standard action, usable per day equal to the blue mage's Intelligence modifier, the blue mage may copy only one special quality from a creature at a time. The only special quality ability that cannot be copied is the creature type. Copying a creature's special qualities overrides her own. This ability lasts for a number of rounds equal to 3 + the blue mage's Intelligence modifier.</p>",
